<title>USA: Getty sets spin-off record date.</title>
<headline>Getty sets spin-off record date.</headline>
<dateline>JERICHO, N.Y. 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Getty Petroleum Corp said it has set March 21 as the record date for the spin-off of its marketing assets and business to its stockholders.</p>
<p>The company also said that in anticipation of the spin-off, on January 31 it transferred the petroleum marketing assets and business to a wholly-owned unit, Getty Petroleum Marketing Inc.</p>
<p>Stockholders of record on March 21 will receive a tax-free dividend of one share of Getty Petroleum Marketing common stock for each share of common stock of the parent company that they own.</p>
</text>
